      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nestled 12 miles northeast of Worcester and 47 miles west of Boston, Berlin sits in a low range of hills between two river valleys.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
