      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berlin%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s first settlement dates back to 1665, with settlers receiving land deeds from Sachem Sholan in 1643.",
